{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:10 2026-09-04 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:10 2026-09-04 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:10 2026-09-04 HKT</p><p>UEFA入稟美國法院求取證後，FIFA在法庭文件指摘UEFA是「對FIFA及其領導層的抹黑行動」。麥比奧莫形容拉舒福特回到曼聯「看起來很開心」，並稱讚隊友有質素。英超轉會窗關閉前出走失敗的李察利臣，被熱刺剔出大軍名單，這名巴西前鋒勢於日內轉會。至於伊斯美拿沙亞轉會利物浦的交易告吹，水晶宮主帥沙治形容愛將需要時間消化。</p><img alt=\"UEFA入稟美國3個州份法院，就FIFA提出出售世界盃股權的計劃取證。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f86a27395e61bbef5b6ce13a693aa0ac/2026-09/AFP__20260807__C48N3T3__v1__HighRes__ColombiaPoliticsInauguration.jpg\"/><img alt=\"拉舒福特在鬥葉士域治一役，正選上陣80分鐘。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/956216f09cde67e7d3047dce43cdb3ec/2026-09/AFP__20260830__C6UY7UQ__v1__HighRes__FblEngPrManUtdIpswich.jpg\"/><img alt=\"李察利臣被剔出熱刺的英超註冊名單。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/10682914d77af48a9ebb41e498f36bb4/2026-09/AFP__20260823__cosgrove-premierl260822_np88L__v1__HighRes__BrentfordVTottenhamHotspu.jpg\"/><img alt=\"英超｜沙亞轉投利物浦告吹 水晶宮主帥沙治：他需要時間消化。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e58abe16884e8e0e22ab721baf1d5b4a/2026-09/AFP__20260306__cosgrove-premierl260305_npHAa__v1__HighRes__TottenhamHotspurVCrystalP.jpg\"/><img alt=\"沙拿希望在特拉布宗找到新挑戰。法新社\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/98c808784357c3e6276b6893af43f562/2026-09/AFP__20260815__MEI-TUR-BKBK-KTTSL-20260815-040__v1__HighRes__KasimpasaVsTrabzonsporT.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T00:19:05.690852+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}